WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.535
-Hey, guys, WrestleMania 35
is this weekend,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:06.005
and my favorite part
is all the smack talk.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:07.073
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.541
You gotta make
your opponent scared

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.343
before they even step
into the ring with you.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.677
So, it got me thinking,

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:14.714
could wrestlers make any
trash talk seem intimidating?

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.550
To find out, we asked kids
to send us their best taunts

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.354
and see if WWE superstars could
still make them terrifying.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.023
It's time for "Kid Trash Talk."
Here we go.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.692
♪♪

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.761
-♪ Kids talk trash ♪

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.264
♪ Trash talk ♪

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.931
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.931 --> 00:00:35.601
-Now, remember, these were all
written by real kids.

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.537
Here to do our first taunt

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.507
is the winner of last year's
WWE Greatest Royal Rumble.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:44.177
Give it up for Braun Strowman!

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.179
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:52.284
♪♪

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:54.220
-You want a piece of me?!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.821
Do you want a piece of me?!

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:58.758
I'm gonna kick your butt
till you fall in a lake.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.159
And I'm not joking!

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:03.496
Because when I'm kidding,
I say, "Knock, knock!"

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.498
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:09.835
♪♪

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.972
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:16.409
-[ Laughing ]
All right.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:21.147
Next, give it up for the former
WWE SmackDown Women's Champion,

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.815
Carmella!

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:25.318
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:31.157
♪♪

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.992
-Come at me, you noodle.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.094
I'll wax you New York style.

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:38.932
♪♪

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.700
-Mm, wow.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.471
Next up is the two-time
WWE Tag Team Champion,

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.373
Drew McIntyre!

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:50.042
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:56.082
♪♪

00:01:56.082 --> 00:02:00.954
-I am gonna shove my foot
so far up your butt...

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:05.458
that you are gonna be
pooping toes for a week!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.959
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:13.132
♪♪

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:18.571
-Next, give it up for three-time
WWE Raw Women's Champion

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.907
Alexa Bliss!

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:23.576
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:26.145
♪♪

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:29.482
-I'm hungry.
So guess what I'm gonna do?

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.785
I'm gonna take your lunch box
and eat your lunch.

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.654
-Whoa.
-Gosh.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:40.426
♪♪

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:41.760
Next up is one of

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.865
the longest-reigning tag team
champions in WWE history,

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.767
Kofi Kingston!

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.769
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:53.105
♪♪

00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:55.441
-Yeah. Hold up, hold up,
hold up, hold up.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.809
Hey, check it out.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.878
You look like a potato and
a chicken nugget had a baby!

00:02:59.878 --> 00:03:02.114
Oh!
Got 'em!

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:06.318
♪♪

00:03:06.318 --> 00:03:11.190
-And, finally, we have
a two-time WWE World Champion.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.060
Give it up for Seth Rollins!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.062
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:22.402
♪♪

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:26.005
-Don't make me bake a pie
and put your face in it,

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.074
'cause your butt is your face,

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:30.776
and your face is your butt!

00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:32.778
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.380
♪♪

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:38.184
-Give it up
for the WWE superstars!

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:42.254
WrestleMania 35 will take place
at MetLife Stadium

00:03:42.254 --> 00:03:45.792
this Sunday, April 7th,
at 7:00 P.M. Eastern,

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:48.694
and will stream live
on WWE Network.

00:03:48.694 --> 00:03:51.864
Stick around. We'll be
right back with Alec Baldwin.

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:54.767
♪♪

